[en.FOCUS_C08_SPARKING_FIRE]
Sparkling Fire

[en.FOCUS_C08_SPARKING_FIRE_desc]
While Equestria is no longer shining, the resistance army is still alive, inheriting the will of Celestia and Twilight, preserving the fire of harmonism. It has become a haven, a beacon of Equestria, illuminating the hope of all ponies.

[zh.FOCUS_C08_SPARKING_FIRE]
星星之火

[zh.FOCUS_C08_SPARKING_FIRE_desc]
小马利亚光芒黯淡，而抵抗军星火未熄，继承塞拉斯蒂娅和暮光闪闪的意志，保存着谐律的火种。它成为了避风港，成为了小马利亚的一盏明灯，照亮着的，是所有小马们的希望。

